# Template: data_group. One data diagram spanning several tables; lettered
# data diagrams use parts / part_of.
# Required: ready, kind, id, title, entities.
# Optional: summary, diagram {nodes, edges}, parts / part_of.
ready: 2
kind: data_group
id: data.overview
display_id: DATA-OVERVIEW
title: Notes data
summary: The tables that hold people's notes.
entities:
  - data.notes
rationale: >-
  One table holds every note because notes have no structure beyond their
  text; the owner on each row keeps every query scoped to one person.
